  "notes": "Single-storey tan villa (~15x13 m) with a low HIPPED roof, center-right of frame, heavily occluded by a low-poly citrus tree and two cypress trees. Warm tan ashlar walls (#a8846a sunlit, shaded ~#845f4c); hipped roof surface a muted warm brown-tan (#8f6d5c) with a cream eave/fascia (#c9b79a). Front (street) facade openings are largely hidden behind the citrus tree, so a modest door + two windows are placed at plausible positions (glass/frame tones borrowed from the neighbouring white block's clearly-visible windows -- #45505f glass, #ece9e0 white frames). Frontage: low sandstone-block compound wall (#c0aa85 blocks, lighter mortar) fronting a terracotta brick-paved plaza/sidewalk (#a86a5a, dark joints), red-and-white kerb (not encodable) and grey asphalt road (#666874) to the right. Environment added 2026-07-05 from the scene ref: two very tall slim dark cypresses (tree_oak, thin dark), a date palm and round green/lime oak trees at the left verge with small base bushes; a raised kerbed planter island in the foreground holds dark purple-toned rocks, dark clipped bushes and a small citrus tree bearing yellow fruit (flower_yellowA marker); a blue sedan (#3d5a82) parked mid-scene and a silver SUV (#c2c5c9) at the right kerb, with a brown wheelie bin beside it. Colours pixel-sampled from the ref."
